Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?pejir-sms/pejir-lte:=20=D0=B6=D0=B4=D0=B0=D1=82?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=D1=8C=20USB-=D0=BC=D0=BE=D0=B4=D0=B5=D0=BC=D0=B0=20=D0=B4?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=D0=BE=D0=BB=D1=8C=D1=88=D0=B5,=20=D0=B8=D1=81=D0=BA=D0=B0?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=D1=82=D1=8C=20AT-=D0=BF=D0=BE=D1=80=D1=82=20=D0=B2=20=D1=84?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=D0=BE=D0=BD=D0=B5?=
